<h1>Joint Minimization of Code and Data for Synchronous Dataflow Programs</h1>


<p>
in the Journal of Formal Methods in Systems Design, Vol. 11, No. 1, pp41-70,
July 1997.>/p>
<p>
by Praveen K. Murthy,
Shuvra S. Bhattacharyya, and 
<a href="http://ptolemy.eecs.berkeley.edu/~eal/">Edward A. Lee</a></p>
</center>

